  "html": "<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"0fbd8161c38d636aa1e8c87c1fe4fa2d\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"-------png\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:137px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/zh/wiki/File:%E7%A5%9E%E7%81%B5.png\" title=\"神灵.png (268 KB)\" style=\"height:185px; width:137px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/9/9b/%E7%A5%9E%E7%81%B5.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/137?cb=20251023162228&amp;path-prefix=zh\" title=\"神灵.png (268 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"神灵.png\" data-image-key=\"%E7%A5%9E%E7%81%B5.png\" data-relevant=\"1\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"神灵.png (268 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"神灵.png\" data-image-key=\"%E7%A5%9E%E7%81%B5.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tragedyrooper/images/9/9b/%E7%A5%9E%E7%81%B5.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/137?cb=20251023162228&amp;path-prefix=zh\"></a></div></div></div></div><p>【角色名】 神灵\n</p><p>【初始区域】 神社\n</p><p>【禁行区域】无\n</p><p>【不安限度】 3\n</p><p>【属性】 男性・女性\n</p><p>【特性】劇本製作時，指定該角色在第几轮轮回登場。在所指定的輪迴之前，該角色不会在轮回准备时配置上场。\n</p><p>【友好能力】（友好3 1L1）公開1個事件的當事人。\n</p><p>（友好5）移除同一區域任意1名角色身上，或者该角色所在版图上的1枚密謀指示物。\n</p><p>【感想】　在禁止聊天规则下突袭主人公的神灵，一定要记得有这么个角色哦\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260927033357\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.024 seconds\nReal ti